00149 {\cf20  * However, this optimization hurts the decompression speed by >30%,}\par
00150 {\cf20  * because the execution does not go to the optimized loop}\par
00151 {\cf20  * for typical compressible data, and all of the preamble checks}\par
00152 {\cf20  * before going to the fall-back path become useless overhead.}\par
00153 {\cf20  * This optimization happens only with the -O3 flag, and -O2 generates}\par
00154 {\cf20  * a simple 8-byte copy loop.}\par
00155 {\cf20  * With gcc on ppc64le, all of the LZ4_decompress_* and LZ4_wildCopy8}\par
00156 {\cf20  * functions are annotated with __attribute__((optimize("O2"))),}\par
00157 {\cf20  * and also LZ4_wildCopy8 is forcibly inlined, so that the O2 attribute}\par
00158 {\cf20  * of LZ4_wildCopy8 does not affect the compression speed.}\par
00159 {\cf20  */}\par
